# 2,560 ids) from ONE load, into ref_musespark_{a,b,c,d,e}. The phases run one after the other.
# Predicted wall [derived], seconds:
#   load      225.6 GB mmapped from /models (nvme0) at ~3-5 GB/s when the page cache holds none of it; nothing repacked on
